==Finnish==

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: pii
*Rhymes: [[tii]]
*{{IPA|[piː]}}

===Etymology 1===

====Noun====
{{fi-noun|pii|type=pii}}

# [[silicon]] (''element, symbol Si'')
# (nautical) The position of a sailing vessel, when she is set so that its bow points steadily to the direction of the wind. Used in expressions:
#*''olla '''piissä'''''
#**to lie [[hove-to]]
#*''asettua '''piihin'''''
#**to [[heave-to]]
# (old-fashioned) [[flint]] (''hard, fine-grained quartz or a piece of it'')
# (old-fashioned) A [[thorn]], [[prong]], [[tooth]] or similar element e.g. in a plant, a saw or a rake.

